// The poly-recursion TEACH (§11 5.3, the question beats the guess):
// an UNSIG'D poly self-call still refuses (HM's mono floor), and the
// refusal now carries T_PolyRecursionSignature naming the fn and the
// signature route. Born RED: the incumbent boot emits the bare
// E_OccursCheck with no teaching narration.
fn depth(x, n) = if n <= 0 { 0 } else { 1 + depth([x], n - 1) }

fn main() = depth(7, 3)
